	measure 'New Customers' = ```
			
			    VAR PeriodStart = MIN(dim_date[date])
			    VAR CustomersInPeriod = 
			        CALCULATETABLE(dim_customer, fact_orders, KEEPFILTERS(dim_customer[customer_id] <> "C00000"))
			    RETURN
			        COUNTROWS(FILTER(CustomersInPeriod, dim_customer[First Order Date] >= PeriodStart))
			```
